# Supabase access

This project has live Supabase MCP access (`user-nurtragise`).

- When you create or change a SQL migration/script, **run it** with `apply_migration` (or `execute_sql` for one-off queries) — do not only leave the file on disk.
- Prefer applying remote changes after writing the matching file under `supabase/migrations/`.
- Use MCP for schema checks, advisors, and debugging when relevant.
